<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#Model> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A mathematical or physical representation of a system or a process, based with sufficient precision upon known laws, identification or specified suppositions."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#DegreeOfAutomation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The proportion of automatic functions to the entire set of functions of a system or plant."@en .
