<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#FinalControllingElement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "IEC 60050-351, 351-49-08. The German term is Stellglied, and a valve is the typical case.\r\n\r\nThe standard places it inside the controlled system. This pattern records that through the relation partOfControlledSystem rather than through a subclass axiom, so another pattern may hold the same valve as a resource executing a process operation without the two contradicting each other."@en .
