<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "IEC 60050-351 Ontology Design Pattern"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ItemUnderConsideration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An object under consideration defined according to function and scope."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#FeedbackPath> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "IEC 60050-351, 351-47-08."@en .
