<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#carriesInformationParameter> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "IEC 60050-351, 351-41-17 and 351-41-18."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#RuleBasedControl> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "IEC 60050-351, 351-47-58. The standard assigns this to closed-loop control explicitly, so the pattern follows rather than leaving it open."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#Evaluate> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "IEC 60050-351, 351-43-13."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#InformationParameter> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A parameter of a signal that represents information according to a rule."@en .
