<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ControlSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "IEC 60050-351, 351-49-06. The outermost frame of Figures 1 and 2, covering an open-loop and a closed-loop control alike."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#Measure> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
