<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#SamplingControl> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Sampling Control"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#realisesFunctionalUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#realisedByPhysicalUnit> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#Observability> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Observability"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#hasVariable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates an automation or a system to a variable quantity involved in it."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#Operate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
