<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#symbol> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The formula symbol the standard gives for a characteristic, for example T_cs for the control settling time."@en .
_:Nf93a732929554f6890019aec78c78c29 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ActionPath> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ClosedActionPath> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Closed Action Path"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#Redundancy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Redundancy"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#hasVariable> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ComparingElement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Comparing Element"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#DisturbanceVariable> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "IEC 60050-351, 351-48-08."@en .
_:Nd1b7b5ff370a4f9585780b52e889a2b5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ControlChain> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#hasAction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has action"@en .
<http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespaceUri> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#OpenActionPath> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An action path between the input variable and the output variable at which no action path goes back from the output variable to the input variable."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespacePrefix> "iec60050" .
