<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#Control> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#quantity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#Actuator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#FunctionalUnit> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#SamplingControl> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Closed-loop control in which the input variables of the controlling system are taken discontinuously in time to generate new values of the manipulated variable, which are updated discontinuously and maintained by holding elements between updates."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#partOfActionPath> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#isTargetOfActionLine> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ActionLine> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#unit> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#partOfControlledSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#FinalControllingElement> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#FinalControlledVariableGeneration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A functional unit that forms the final controlled variable from the controlled variable."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#FunctionalSafety> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "IEC 60050-351, 351-57-06. The standard defines no safety integrity level; IEC 61508 does."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#fromUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#FunctionalUnit> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ClosedAction> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "IEC 60050-351, 351-47-04. This, not the closed path, is what closed-loop control requires."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#CharacteristicValue> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ItemUnderConsideration> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#System> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "IEC 60050-351, 351-42-08."@en .
