<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#RuleBasedControl> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ClosedLoopControl> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#carriesVariable> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "The letters of the figure legends, c, w, e, m, y, x, q and r, are recorded through this relation. Functional: one line carries one variable quantity."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#Action> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ActionPath> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#unit> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "A literal rather than a reference to a unit ontology, so that the pattern stays free of further imports."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#carriesInformationParameter> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#Signal> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#hasReferenceVariable> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "IEC 60050-351, 351-48-02."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#CommandVariable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#InputVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#VariableQuantity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Variable Quantity"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#Plant> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A complete set of technical equipment and facilities for solving a defined technical task."@en .
