<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ControlChain> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#Stability> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The property of a system implying that for a sufficiently small initial displacement from the rest position, or a sufficiently small disturbance, the state variables remain within a sufficiently small neighbourhood of the rest position."@en .
_:N0d0c0a0831214cf5b8df2958d6b2b49d <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:Nae105d2475d54403bf05cf244d054149 .
