<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#OutputVariable> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "IEC 60050-351, 351-41-07."@en .
_:Nfcf8fb81bdb34f42a3608be4a7c9d4d4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#List> .
