<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ControlFunction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A task of control technology performed on or in a process."@en .
_:Nae105d2475d54403bf05cf244d054149 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#isTargetOfActionLine> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a functional unit to an action line ending at it."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#InputVariable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A variable quantity which is acting on a system from the outside and which is independent of the other variable quantities of the system."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#FeedbackVariable> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
