<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#Intervene> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "To modify an automatic procedure by an input of the operator or a prioritized technical unit at an unscheduled instant."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/subject> "Ontology Design Pattern"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#OpenActionPath> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
