<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ComparingElement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "IEC 60050-351, 351-49-03. The summing point of Figure 2, and the place where a closed action path returns."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#Controller> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ControllingElement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "IEC 60050-351, 351-49-04. The German terms are Steuerglied and Regelglied, one entry for both.\r\n\r\nThe entry is the element that appears in Figure 1 as well as in Figure 2, which is why the same class serves an open-loop and a closed-loop control. What differs is the variable at its input, not the unit."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#MeasuringTransmitter> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A measuring transducer the output variable of which is a standardized signal."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#Characteristic> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ControllingElement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#FunctionalUnit> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#StateVariable> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#hasDisturbanceVariable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#DisturbanceVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#FunctionalUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An item under consideration defined according to function or effect."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#CascadeControl> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "IEC 60050-351, 351-47-25."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#actionOverPath> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#Action> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#usesModel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#Model> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ControlSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A functional unit consisting of the controlling system and the controlled system."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#InformationParameter> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#Actuator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Actuator"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#hasManipulatedVariable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#Control> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#OutputVariable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A recordable variable quantity generated by a system, influenced only by the system and via the system by its input variables."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#Notify> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
