<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#partOfControlledSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "IEC 60050-351, 351-49-08 places the final controlling element inside the controlled system.\r\n\r\nStated as a relation rather than a subclass axiom on purpose. VDI 3682 would hold the same valve as a technical resource executing a process operation, and a subclass axiom here would make the two readings contradict. As a relation both stand."@en .
