<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#CharacteristicValue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The value a model assigns to one characteristic, together with its unit."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#Model> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "IEC 60050-351, 351-42-26. The identification named in the definition is the data driven case, so the standard treats an identified model as an equal kind rather than as an exception."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ActiveFault> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#Fault> .
