<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ComputerControl> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A type of control in which a computer is used in the controlling system."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#Observer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A system for the complete reconstruction of the state of a controlled system from measured input and output variables, by means of a model of the controlled system."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ItemUnderConsideration> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#VariableQuantity> .
