<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#AdaptiveControl> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "IEC 60050-351, 351-47-42. The automatic modification is what a learning system performs online."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ComputerControl> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#Control> .
