<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#Controller> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A functional unit, consisting of a comparing element and a controlling element, that performs a specified control function."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ProgrammableController> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "IEC 60050-351, 351-56-25. The standard defines no programmable logic controller as a device; 351-47-22 covers that as a kind of control instead."@en .
