<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#actsOn> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "IEC 60050-351, 351-49-01 and 351-49-02."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Marvin Schieseck" .
