<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ForwardPath> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "IEC 60050-351, 351-47-07."@en .
_:N2284858a1e474ac8a4a84b7bf9a1b95a <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:N899eabd481874d0ba1908f3194565ad7 .
