<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#Action> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#Characteristic> .
_:N6b8202f4bf624301aec145e55c59d7ea <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#List> .
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#OptimalControl> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Optimal Control"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ComparingElement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A functional unit that forms the control difference variable from the reference variable and the feedback variable."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#TimeCharacteristic> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A characteristic expressed as a duration."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#FuzzyControl> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#fromUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "from unit"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#partOfActionPath> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "The inverse of hasActionLine. With it a model can go from a line to the path and on to the control running over it, which is how a device reaches the kind of control it takes part in."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#OpenLoopControl> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#FeedbackPath> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An action path connecting an output of the controlled system to one of the inputs of the related comparing element."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#TimeCharacteristic> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#Characteristic> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#FinalControllingEquipment> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ControlDifferenceVariable> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "IEC 60050-351, 351-48-05, marked e in Figure 2. It exists only where a comparison takes place, which is why it appears in the closed-loop figure alone."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#FuzzyControl> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Fuzzy Control"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050> <http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/status> "Draft"@en .
