<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ControlFunction> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Collecting class of this pattern for the tasks of 351-43. The standard lists them as verbs without naming a common superclass."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#hasCharacteristicValue> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#unit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#CharacteristicValue> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ItemUnderConsideration> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#QualityCharacteristic> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Grouping of this pattern, covering overshoot and the stability margins."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#quantity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ItemUnderConsideration> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "IEC 60050-351, 351-56-01."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#hasManipulatedVariable> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "IEC 60050-351, 351-48-07. Present in open-loop as in closed-loop control."@en .
