<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#FuzzyControl> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "IEC 60050-351, 351-47-56."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#FeedbackVariable> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "IEC 60050-351, 351-48-03."@en .
