<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ControllingSystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Controlling System"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ControlChain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A set of elements or systems which act upon one another in a series structure."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#hasDisturbanceVariable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a system to a disturbance variable acting on it from the outside."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ControlledVariable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#OutputVariable> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ModelBasedControl> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Model-based Control"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#OutputVariable> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#Plant> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "IEC 60050-351, 351-42-35. The technical process pattern has no class for the plant as a whole, only for its individual resources, so this fills a gap rather than duplicating one."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#hasControlledVariable> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "IEC 60050-351, 351-48-01. Only closed-loop control has one, since the controlled variable is what is measured and compared."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#symbol> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "IEC 60050-351 states a formula symbol for most characteristics of 351-45 and 351-46, which makes a model checkable against the figures of the standard."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ClosedLoopControl> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A process whereby one variable quantity, namely the controlled variable, is continuously or sequentially measured, compared with another variable quantity, namely the reference variable, and influenced in such a manner as to adjust to the reference variable."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#forCharacteristic> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#CharacteristicValue> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iec60050#ProgrammableController> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Programmable Controller"@en .
